    "chunk_text": "enan kyningce gebyra\u00f0 swy\u00f0e rihte, \u00fe\u00e6t he Godes \u00e6bylg\u00f0e wrece swy\u00f0e deope, be \u00f0am \u00fee seo Gyf weofed\u00feen manslaga weor\u00f0e o\u00f0\u00f0on elles to swy\u00f0e manweorc gewyrce, \u00feonne \u00feolige he \u00e6g\u00feer ge & gyf he ladian wylle, ladige mid \u00feryfealdan. & butan he binnan XXX nihton bote aginne wi\u00f0 God & wi\u00f0 men, \u00feonne si he utlah. Gyf hwa gehadodne man bende o\u00f0\u00f0on beate o\u00f0\u00f0on swy\u00f0e gebysmrige, bete wi\u00f0 hine, swa swa hit riht Gyf gehadod man hine forwyrce mid dea\u00f0scylde, gewylde hine man & healde to bisceopes dome, be Gif dea\u00f0scyldig man scriftsp\u00e6ce gyrne, ne wyrne him man \u00e6fre. & gif him hwa wyrne, gebete \u00fe\u00e6t wi\u00f0 \u00feone cing mid CXX scyllingum; o\u00f0\u00fee geladige hine: nime V & Gyf man wealdan m\u00e6ge, ne dyde man \u00e6fre on Sunnand\u00e6ges freolse \u00e6nigne forwyrhtne man, butan he Gyf freoman freolsd\u00e6ge wyrce, \u00feonne gebete \u00fe\u00e6t mid his halsfange, & huru wi\u00f0 God bete hit georne, \u00deeowman gif wyrce, \u00feolige his hyde o\u00f0\u00f0on hydgyldes, be \u00feam seo d\u00e6d sy. Gyf hlaford his \u00feeowan freolsd\u00e6ge nyde to weorce, \u00feolige \u00fe\u00e6s \u00feeowan; & beo he sy\u00f0\u00f0an folcfrig; & Gif frigman riht f\u00e6sten abrece, gilde lahslit mid Denum, wite mid Englum, be \u00feam \u00fee seo d\u00e6d sy. Yfel by\u00f0, \u00fe",
